{"id":"b4c1ab1358773e54","group":"20","path":"20/20-thm-konig.md","title":"二进制树的 König 引理","display":"thm-konig — 二进制树的 König 引理","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-thm-konig","aliases":["20-thm-konig"],"display":"thm-konig — 二进制树的 König 引理","chapter":"8","section":"8.3","source_kind":"book","verification_status":"reviewed","source_reference":"Theorem 8.3.1 的树版本","source_pdf_pages":[201],"source_printed_pages":[168],"depends_on":["[[20-df-tree]]","[[20-df-extendible]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-thm-konig"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-thm-konig</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-konig — 二进制树的 König 引理"},{"key":"chapter","html":"8"},{"key":"section","html":"8.3"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"reviewed"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Theorem 8.3.1 的树版本"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>201</span></div>"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>168</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"93a810534b87b0f9\" href=\"?note=93a810534b87b0f9\" title=\"20-df-tree\">20-df-tree</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"8705fb72e379b21a\" href=\"?note=8705fb72e379b21a\" title=\"20-df-extendible\">20-df-extendible</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\subseteq2^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(T\\subseteq2^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span> 为树。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"93a810534b87b0f9\" href=\"?note=93a810534b87b0f9\" title=\"20-df-tree\">20-df-tree</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"8705fb72e379b21a\" href=\"?note=8705fb72e379b21a\" title=\"20-df-extendible\">20-df-extendible</a>。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T^{\\mathrm{ext}}\">\\(T^{\\mathrm{ext}}\\)</span> 表示具有任意长延伸的节点集合，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T^{\\mathrm{path}}\">\\(T^{\\mathrm{path}}\\)</span> 表示位于无限路径上的节点集合；二者按上游 extendible 定义。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}konig}\\vdash\n[T]\\ne\\varnothing\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall n\\ [T\\cap2^n\\ne\\varnothing],\\qquad T^{\\mathrm{ext}}=T^{\\mathrm{path}}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}konig}\\vdash\n[T]\\ne\\varnothing\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall n\\ [T\\cap2^n\\ne\\varnothing],\\qquad T^{\\mathrm{ext}}=T^{\\mathrm{path}}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>若某节点有任意长延伸，其两个子节点至少一个仍有任意长延伸；否则两个有限高度界给父节点有限高度。依次选择这样的子节点得到路径。应用于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T_\\sigma\">\\(T_\\sigma\\)</span> 得后一个等式。</p>\n<p>来源：Theorem 8.3.1 的树版本；印刷页 168；PDF 第 201 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-tree","status":"resolved","id":"93a810534b87b0f9","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-tree]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-extendible","status":"resolved","id":"8705fb72e379b21a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-extendible]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-tree","status":"resolved","id":"93a810534b87b0f9","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-tree]]；see [[20-df-extendible]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-extendible","status":"resolved","id":"8705fb72e379b21a","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-tree]]；see [[20-df-extendible]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"T\\subseteq2^{<\\omega}","display":false},{"tex":"T^{\\mathrm{ext}}","display":false},{"tex":"T^{\\mathrm{path}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}konig}\\vdash\n[T]\\ne\\varnothing\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall n\\ [T\\cap2^n\\ne\\varnothing],\\qquad T^{\\mathrm{ext}}=T^{\\mathrm{path}}.","display":true},{"tex":"T_\\sigma","display":false}],"bytes":1285,"backlinks":[{"id":"8609481d2b84cdde","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-finite-winning-certificate]]；see [[20-thm-konig]]；see [[20-df-finite-code]]；see [[20-df-computable]]。"},{"id":"4ffcd8be1ef80ce4","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-tree]]；see [[20-df-extendible]]；see [[20-df-cantor-bendixson]]；see [[20-thm-konig]]；see [[20-thm-rel-post]]；see [[20-df-recursive]]。"},{"id":"84785d7ea3ad1a08","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-cantor-space]]；see [[20-df-closed-class]]；see [[20-thm-konig]]。"},{"id":"49047c938f7aef20","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-closed-class]]；see [[20-df-extendible]]；see [[20-df-jump]]；see [[20-thm-konig]]；see [[20-thm-K-one-complete]]。"},{"id":"927f4ead14ec3c2d","anchor":"ref-11","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-closed-class]]；see [[20-df-finite-code]]；see [[20-thm-cantor-compactness]]；see [[20-thm-konig]]；see [[20-df-stages]]；see [[20-df-computable]]；see [[20-df-pairing]]。"},{"id":"005203b6707a19f4","anchor":"ref-135","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[20-thm-konig]] — 章 8；直接提供者 2 个。"},{"id":"f4368dd1